# api/

Rust crate providing gRPC API definitions, client/server stubs, and protocol buffer bindings for Udex. The build process automatically generates code from protobuf definitions, applies Serde serialization support, and handles code generation into the `src/generated` directory.

## Dirs

- `src/` -- Core library exports, generated protobuf modules, timestamp utilities, and context hashing logic

## Files

- `build.rs` -- Protobuf compilation script using tonic-build; generates Rust code with Serde support and fixes well-known types doc tests
- `Cargo.toml` -- Package metadata and workspace dependency declarations for the udex-api crate
- `README.md` -- Usage documentation with client/server examples and development guidelines for protobuf code generation
